# Ignore everything in PnL WatchDog except the files we want
PnL WatchDog/*
!PnL WatchDog/pnl_watchdog_lib/
!PnL WatchDog/pnl_watchdog_lib/**
!PnL WatchDog/tests/
!PnL WatchDog/tests/**
!PnL WatchDog/Dockerfile
!PnL WatchDog/docker-compose.yml
!PnL WatchDog/main.py
!PnL WatchDog/requirements.txt
!PnL WatchDog/README.md
!PnL WatchDog/debug_discord.py
!PnL WatchDog/pyproject.toml